{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近忽然变真切，他身体先绷紧，才想起那种生活没回来，懊恼自己刚沉进满足就忘了还有事要面对。\",\n      \"key\": \"熟悉的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心只在心里怀念那种生活，因为当初不肯再等，就是怕珍惜的东西继续受损，光怀念护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"光怀念护不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想重新投入，却不敢毫无顾忌，怕自己又只顾硬撑，把刚找回的温柔磨掉，连想争取的心也没了。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再等下去会失去珍惜的东西，也怕争取时磨掉温柔，心里反而更难定下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"更难定下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\", \"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"保留熟悉的亲近突然变得真切、身体先于意识受惊的过程，并补回他刚沉进满足就忘了现实、因此懊恼自责的心理事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不能只靠怀念改变现实，以及最初不肯再等是怕珍惜的东西继续受损的具体理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留重新投入的困难，以及怕硬撑磨掉刚找回的温柔、连争取的心也失去的恐惧。R38重复概括两面风险，压入已有条目，不再单列。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉前史没有明确建立的、以为想清理由便能彻底定下来的判断。保留他同时记着等待的代价、又害怕争取的代价，因此更难决定的事实。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料身份的另一种辨认，不是必须成立的人物心理经历，也不与主体验合并解释。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0046f73e-747e-4c50-8085-243b14b197bf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003028434400Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:32:16.196290+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df369de0d2192b78141ea76feed7c4bb11feff839ef24a2e7eaeb36379cf30fb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-brid